        "id": 1940250
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-08-05T15:25:57Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "1.This doesn\u0027t seem to add any value compared to trace_android_rvh_check_preempt_tick(), why is it needed?\n------------------------------\nwe will compare tsk-\u003elock_start_time and now to judge clear tsk-\u003elock_start_time(cancle to protect the process in wakeup_preeempt);\n\n2.In this case there is always a lock that has been taken recently, so the task never gets preempted?\n----------------------------\nNo, we only record the last lock-hold-time, and clear it in any unlock.\n\nlock(a)     record lock_strat_time\nlock(b)     update lock_strat_time\nunlock(a)   clear lock_strat_time\nlock(a)     record lock_strat_time\nunlock(b)   clear lock_strat_time\n\nonly lock_strat_time \u003e 0, the process can be protected from being preempted in wakeup_preempt.\nMeanwhile, lock_start_time will be clear in check_preempt_tick()-\u003etrace_android_vh_locktask_tick_resched().",
      "parentUuid": "30ad51ec_f27a98a7",
