      "message": "\u003e we will compare tsk-\u003elock_start_time and now to judge clear tsk-\u003elock_start_time(cancle to protect the process in wakeup_preeempt);\n\nAnd is there any reason why that can\u0027t be done by attaching to trace_android_rvh_check_preempt_tick()? It takes more parameters than needed, but I don\u0027t see how that can be a problem.\n\n\u003e No, we only record the last lock-hold-time, and clear it in any unlock.\n\nRight, so this is not as bad, but still a task that keeps taking and releasing a mutex might be in a position to cause fairness issues :(",
